  "abstract_summary": "Efficient detection of empty retail-shelf regions can support timely replenishment and reduce stockout risk. This study presents StockSense-R2, a robust and cost-aware shelf-void detection framework based on YOLOv8s. The framework combines transfer learning, controlled augmentation, confidence-threshold optimization...",
